+    alpha * z_i for local expert i, z_i ~ (i + 1)^-0.8 normalised to mean 1 (a few hot experts, a long tail).
+    alpha sets the local-route count; _rega_pop_alpha calibrates it to ~REGA_LO_POP_TARGET x the uniform one."""
